  "translation": "Gomme Yehoshabeata, morwedi wa kgoši, a tšera ⟨את⟩ Yoasha morwa wa Akhaziahu, a mo utswa legareng ga bana ba kgoši bao ba bolailwego, a mo bea yena le ⟨את⟩ mmanyedi wa gage phokong ya ditulo; Yehoshabeata, morwedi wa kgoši Yehorame, mosadi wa Yehoyada moperisita, e be e le kgaetšedi ya Akhaziahu, mo hideletše go tšwa go Ataliahu, gomme a sa mo bolaya.",
